                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs flex-wrap">
                            <span class="text-slate-400 font-medium">快捷批次:</span>
                            <button id="btnBatchFull" class="bg-macaron-mintLight hover:bg-macaron-mint text-teal-800 font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 transition">
                                🟢 全部全日 OK
